+//   EDEN_NX2_HVF_LOOP=N        run up to N following instructions of a fill or copy loop per exit (0 = off)
+//   EDEN_NX2_HVF_BURST=N       interpret up to N more consecutive loads/stores after a faulting one
+//   EDEN_NX2_HVF_DIRTY_ONLY=1  write back only the registers the interpreter changed
